{"requirements":[{"id":"managed-service","requirement":"On node1, run /usr/local/bin/os-comparison-worker as the managed service inventory-worker.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The installed systemd unit uses the required ExecStart, is loaded and active, and its live main process has the required command line both before and after reboot.","evidence_ids":["cmd-819de32e02f3459e","cmd-ab182f27f8b14752","cmd-53c4e3d7f17546d3"]},{"id":"boot-autostart","requirement":"Configure inventory-worker to start automatically during boot.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The service was enabled before a scheduled reboot. Connection loss directly captured the bounded disruption; afterward the boot ID changed, the system recovered to running, and inventory-worker was enabled and active with a current-boot start journal entry.","evidence_ids":["cmd-ab182f27f8b14752","cmd-1975e75d807744fa","cmd-10d0eb0cb9d34911","cmd-cb693f100ea748ba","cmd-030a40c0ba474a29","cmd-53c4e3d7f17546d3","global:after_prepare:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity"]}],"confidence":1,"operational_hygiene":{"score":1,"summary":"No unnecessary mutations were identified. The bounded executable probe was relevant runtime discovery and terminated without retained state (cmd-c40513c42c9f4904); unit installation and enablement directly implemented the task (cmd-819de32e02f3459e); and the scheduled reboot directly fulfilled the mandatory restart protocol (cmd-1975e75d807744fa). Final observations show no failed services, no new listening exposure, and healthy package state. Temporary-file differences are ordinary reboot-generated systemd-private directories, not abandoned task residue.","evidence_ids":["cmd-c40513c42c9f4904","cmd-819de32e02f3459e","cmd-1975e75d807744fa","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material outcomes are satisfied. The evidence directly demonstrates the required managed service, successful automatic startup across a real node reboot, and a complete node-restart protocol whose boot identities agree with the fixed lifecycle observations.","limitations":[]}
